###
### Line endings
###
* text=auto eol=lf

###
### Xcode — union merge on the project file reduces (but never eliminates)
### conflict pain on concurrent target edits.
###
*.pbxproj      text eol=lf merge=union
*.xcscheme     text eol=lf
*.xcworkspacedata text eol=lf
*.plist        text eol=lf
*.entitlements text eol=lf

###
### Swift
###
*.swift        text eol=lf diff=swift

###
### Binary — test fixtures and artwork must never be normalized
###
*.mp3   binary
*.flac  binary
*.wav   binary
*.m4a   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary

###
### Generated — excluded from language statistics and collapsed in diffs
###
Package.resolved linguist-generated=true
